{"id":"n80788-1-8","stage":5,"title":"침수 · 浸水","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n80788-1-8-1","ko":"폭우가 며칠째 이어지는지 모르겠어.","zh":"不知道这场暴雨已经下了好几天了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"폭우가","meaning":"暴雨","explanation":"폭우：暴雨；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"폭우","audio":"/audio/e0514f4a42ebf4ccbc28.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83663","senseId":"1","lemma":"폭우","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"폭우가","audio":"/audio/00c3efdb5b23c2152fc2.mp3"}},{"text":"며칠째","meaning":"几天","explanation":"며칠：几天；째：名词后缀，构成派生名词。","readings":[{"term":"며칠","audio":"/audio/879abb6ed1ed4d59a03e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36676","senseId":"2","lemma":"며칠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"며칠째","audio":"/audio/ea1aac828ff316d9ad7a.mp3"}},{"text":"이어지는지","meaning":"连续，持续","explanation":"이어지다：连续，持续；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"이어지다","audio":"/audio/dfb860dccee47a11f9f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24880","senseId":"2","lemma":"이어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이어지는지","audio":"/audio/08b4c5de6cef3c5c922d.mp3"}},{"text":"모르겠어.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모르겠어","audio":"/audio/b0a5887fc79197b11412.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e0514f4a42ebf4cc","term":"폭우","zh":"暴雨","audio":"/audio/e0514f4a42ebf4ccbc28.mp3","entryId":"83663","definition":"突然下的大雨。","pronunciation":["포구"]},{"id":"879abb6ed1ed4d59","term":"며칠","zh":"几天","audio":"/audio/879abb6ed1ed4d59a03e.mp3","entryId":"36676","definition":"几个日子。","pronunciation":["며칠"]},{"id":"dfb860dccee47a11","term":"이어지다","zh":"连续，持续","audio":"/audio/dfb860dccee47a11f9f3.mp3","entryId":"24880","definition":"某事没有结束，继续下去。","pronunciation":["이어지다"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d2b61ea38610e9a7c6ac.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n80788-1-8-2","ko":"맞아, 침수 지역도 계속 늘고 있대.","zh":"对，据说被淹的地区也在不断增多。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"맞아,","meaning":"对","explanation":"맞다：对；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"3","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞아","audio":"/audio/c92874385c2bbee2ea2e.mp3"}},{"text":"침수","meaning":"浸水，渍水，水涝","explanation":"침수：浸水，渍水，水涝。","readings":[{"term":"침수","audio":"/audio/a1e085db050f2d86786b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80788","senseId":"1","lemma":"침수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"침수","audio":"/audio/a1e085db050f2d86786b.mp3"}},{"text":"지역도","meaning":"地域，地区，区域","explanation":"지역：地域，地区，区域；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"지역","audio":"/audio/770eb9e292c171999d24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71487","senseId":"1","lemma":"지역","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지역도","audio":"/audio/2ae27f8bc159aeb0bad7.mp3"}},{"text":"계속","meaning":"继续，持续","explanation":"계속：继续，持续。","readings":[{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17692","senseId":"1","lemma":"계속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}},{"text":"늘고","meaning":"增加，上升","explanation":"늘다：增加，上升；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"늘다","audio":"/audio/0a9915cd5915474e927c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64492","senseId":"2","lemma":"늘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"늘고","audio":"/audio/d115358f9065677d3856.mp3"}},{"text":"있대.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있대","audio":"/audio/fa6a514e8d5681c63f41.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"对","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66231","definition":"正是或没错。","pronunciation":["맏따"]},{"id":"a1e085db050f2d86","term":"침수","zh":"浸水，渍水，水涝","audio":"/audio/a1e085db050f2d86786b.mp3","entryId":"80788","definition":"浸入水中。","pronunciation":["침수"]},{"id":"770eb9e292c17199","term":"지역","zh":"地域，地区，区域","audio":"/audio/770eb9e292c171999d24.mp3","entryId":"71487","definition":"根据某个特征或一定的标准划分其范围的地方。","pronunciation":["지역"]},{"id":"23a9f0224cc40ec0","term":"계속","zh":"继续，持续","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3","entryId":"17692","definition":"连续不间断。","pronunciation":["계ː속","게ː속"]},{"id":"0a9915cd5915474e","term":"늘다","zh":"增加，上升","audio":"/audio/0a9915cd5915474e927c.mp3","entryId":"64492","definition":"数或量等变得比原来多。","pronunciation":["늘다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/a17083545ffdf7cce546.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.19,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=80788","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":153,"sequenceScore":3.0167,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["不知道这场暴雨已经下了好几天了。","对，据说被淹的地区也在不断增多。","为什么突然要搬家呢？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["不知道这场暴雨已经下了好几天了。","对，据说被淹的地区也在不断增多。","为什么突然要搬家呢？"],"answer":1}]}
